        "<h1>Content Viewer</h1>\n<p>Wire anything into it and look at it, in the graph. This document was written in the\n<strong>Rich Text Editor</strong> beside it, so what reaches the viewer is HTML and the\nHTML view claims it.</p>\n<h2>What the editor emits</h2>\n<table><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Node</th><th>Carries</th></tr>\n<tr><td>read</td><td>Load Text Line</td><td>one line, or every line</td></tr>\n<tr><td>build</td><td>Text to DOC</td><td>a <code>DOC</code> on the wire</td></tr>\n<tr><td>pack</td><td>ZIP Add</td><td>the archive, in memory</td></tr></table>\n<ul><li>Headings, tables and lists</li>\n<li><em>Italic</em>, <strong>bold</strong> and <u>underline</u></li>\n<li>A <a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\">link</a></li></ul>\n<blockquote>Auto picks the view. The dropdown beside it changes the view to any other.</blockquote>",
