      "widgets_values": [
        "# Typed into the node\n\nNothing is wired into this one. The content was typed into the viewer itself, which is\nsaved with the workflow and passed downstream.\n\n| Stage | Node | Carries |\n|---|---|---|\n| read | Load Text Line | one line, or every line |\n| pack | ZIP Add | the archive, in memory |\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  A[Load Image] --> B[Image Statistics]\n  B --> C{entropy < 4.5?}\n  C -->|yes| D[Apply LUT]\n  C -->|no| E[Save Image]\n```\n\nShannon entropy of the frame:\n\n$$H = -\\sum_{i=0}^{255} p_i \\log_2 p_i$$",
        "{\"lastInputHash\": \"\", \"excluded\": []}",
        "{}",
        false,
        600
      ]
